{"id":"H0805","lemma":"אֲשׁוּרִי","transliteration":"ashuri","sayIt":"a-shu-ri","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Asshurim","meaning":"Someone descended from Asshur(?) of the Patriarchs, only mentioned at Gen.25.3; descended from Dedan (H1719C); along with Letushim (H3912) and Leummim (H3817)\n§ Ashurites = \"guided: blessed\"\na tribe descended from Abraham and Keturah","glosses":["asshurites","asher"],"count":2,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-25","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"the Asshurites","kjv":"were Asshurim"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-2","v":9,"renderings":{"bsb":"Asher","kjv":"and over the Ashurites"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 25:3","note":"Jokshan became the father of Sheba, and Dedan. The sons of Dedan were Asshurim, Letushim, and Leummim.","source":"web"},{"ref":"2 Samuel 2:9","note":"and he made him king over Gilead, and over the Ashurites, and over Jezreel, and over Ephraim, and over Benjamin, and over all Israel.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0836","lemma":"אָשֵׁר","transliteration":"asher","gloss":"Asher"},{"id":"H1719","lemma":"דְּדָן","transliteration":"dedan","gloss":"Dedan"},{"id":"H3912","lemma":"לְטוּשִׁם","transliteration":"letushim","gloss":"Letushim"},{"id":"H3817","lemma":"לְאֻמִּ֑ים","transliteration":"leummim","gloss":"Leummim"},{"id":"H3478","lemma":"יִשְׂרָאֵל","transliteration":"yisrael","gloss":"Israel"},{"id":"H2153","lemma":"זִלְפָּה","transliteration":"zilpah","gloss":"Zilpah"},{"id":"H1410","lemma":"גָּד","transliteration":"gad","gloss":"Gad"},{"id":"H7205","lemma":"רְאוּבֵן","transliteration":"reuven","gloss":"Reuben"}],"senses":[{"id":"H0805B","gloss":"Ashurite","relation":"H0805B = a group of"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}